            "review_title": "Review at The Mad Den",
            "review_text": "GracoJr\nCrumlin, United Kingdom100 contributions\n0\nIrish bar, football, dartboard and more!\nOct 2022 • Friends\nI came across this friendly irish bar on a bar crawl, shows football and other sports. Has a dartboard and air hockey which is great for a bit of craic!\n\nGood beers, good company, feels very well ran and I would recommend this as a stop off or even a bar to spend your night at!\nWritten November 27, 2022",
